# Loopback only.
#
# There is no eth0 on this board. The S31 has an Ethernet MAC, but the Korvo-1
# brings out no PHY, and networking comes from ESP-Hosted as wlan0. An
# "auto eth0 / iface eth0 inet dhcp" stanza was here and cost about 30 seconds
# of every boot: ifup -a blocked trying to DHCP an interface that will never
# exist, printing "Cannot find device eth0" and then failing.
#
# wlan0 is deliberately not brought up here. It needs wpa_supplicant with
# credentials that are not in this tree, so it is configured at runtime.
auto lo
iface lo inet loopback
